{"overview":{"Symbol":"GLOO","Name":"Gloo Holdings, Inc.","Description":"Gloo Holdings, Inc. designs and develops a vertical technology platform for the faith and flourishing ecosystem. It offers its products and services to network capability providers (NCPs) and the churches and frontline organizations (CFLs). The company's platform includes Gloo Workspace, a subscription-based platform that includes a suite of AI-powered tools that equip customers to create content and communicate with their congregations and extend their ministry; Gloo 360, a solution for NCPs designed to modernize, operate, and transform core IT infrastructure; Gloo Media Network, a full-service platform to help organizations expand awareness, deepen engagement, and increase donor support; and Gloo AI, a vertical-specific faith- and flourishing-based AI. Gloo Holdings, Inc. was founded in 2013 and is based in Boulder, Colorado.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Technology","Industry":"Software - Application","Address":"831 Pearl Street, Boulder, CO, 80302, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"372782368","EBITDA":"-99471000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"1.678","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-1.83","RevenuePerShareTTM":"3.034","ProfitMargin":"-1.191","OperatingMarginTTM":"-0.45124","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-1.88072","RevenueTTM":"123888000","GrossProfitTTM":"33107000","DilutedEPSTTM":"-1.83","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"2.376","AnalystTargetPrice":"13.2","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"15.133332","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"3.0090272","PriceToBookRatio":"2.705602","EVToRevenue":"3.302","EVToEBITDA":"-4.113","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"9.98","52WeekLow":"4.46","50DayMovingAverage":"6.0646","200DayMovingAverage":"6.2285357","SharesOutstanding":"20793009","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"29.035"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. 